# Vain (Windurst 8-1, mission.windurst.vain), the western zone-ins (Tahrongi, Meriphataud, Sauromugue, Rolanberry,
# Zitah) by the zone before. Status 1 (a GM): each zone-in plays its event, left open; its update sends the sky (0, 0,
# 0, 0, 0, n) the position or the zone before picks, or nothing; the finish closes it. A warp to 0,0,0 is 1,0,1 (a
# zone's onZoneIn sets a char at 0,0,0 down at its own spot); a warp inside a zone keeps the zone before it.
